    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 1fa89639-c2b1-4ba9-a207-27b32f5571e1)
  )
  (text "ULVO / EN PIN\nis turning off regulation below 1.5V\nUsed as combined UV shutoff and board reset. "
    (at 163.195 19.685 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 24a22a31-5790-496d-bd3c-2238ffd83cb1)
  )
  (text "UVLO = ~9V\nAdjusted by R16 and R17//R49" (at 128.27 21.59 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 2992d9cd-89e8-43f3-9cf5-e3df7f6c96fb)
  )
  (text "CD4060 is a 14 bit coutner with internal oscillator\nOscillator is setup with C and R as below:\n\nf = 1 / ( 2.5 x R x C)\n\nf = 1 / (2.5 * 220k * 1u) = 1.8Hz\n1/1.8Hz = 0.55 sec\n\n0b10000000000000 = 8192\n0.55sec * 8192 = ~75min\n\nQ13 is turned HIGH after around 75min\ntoggle WDI will reset counter\nPower cycle will reset counter\n"
    (at 271.78 123.825 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 2b283ffe-bc5a-45dd-bc47-aa2696b95b05)
  )
  (text ">100 ms" (at 817.88 103.505 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 317129bb-7469-4344-a386-7af20a7c3ea0)
  )
  (text "Llv shift modem serial" (at 579.12 267.97 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 3183f70a-406c-4d80-b6c6-c16869627313)
  )
  (text "GSM / GNSS antenna an PI-network\n[ONLY PLACEHOLDER COMPONENTS]\n"
